{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Protagonist</strong> \u2013 Play as <strong>Bonnie</strong>, a bounty hunter bunny with style, wit, and firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruitable Allies</strong> \u2013 Team up with characters like a Robot and even\u00a0<strong>Selka</strong> from <i>Grand Sands</i>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Armor</strong> \u2013 Equip and deck out your characters in drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in <strong>side-by-side battles</strong> with blasters, laser weapons, and tactical skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Survive</strong> \u2013 Scavenge resources, loot dungeons, and build your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Brave dungeons, ruins, and alien strongholds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaceship Exploration</strong> \u2013 Recover your lost ship and blaze a trail across the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Adventure</strong> \u2013 A mix of sci-fi bounty hunting, survival, and RPG dungeon crawling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Questing -</strong>\u00a0Yes, there's even quests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Bonnie</strong> Save the GALAXY --- Or at least help get her ship back and pay back her dues to <strong>Myiss Kyzorga</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photosensitivity Warning: Use of flashing lights!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084500?t=1772179241","background_raw":"htt